# Fleet votes and their callbacks.

card dec_signal
type decision
days 5 14
weight 10
once
duration 2
roles A B
lean curious open log
when trait A curious >= 10
when trait B curious <= 5
text The asteroid off the port bow is repeating a pattern. {A} wants to answer it. {B} wants to log it and keep going.
option open | Open the channel | {A} keys the transmitter and the whole fleet listens to static for an hour.
  set signal_answered
  mark t_signal
  res fuel -3
  trait A curious 5
option log | Log it, move on | The pattern is filed under "later". {A} pins a printout of it above the bunk, just in case.
  set signal_ignored
  mark t_signal
  morale A -5

# Weeks later: the callback for whichever way the fleet voted.
card signal_reply
type event
due
once
days 15 41
roles A
when flag signal_answered
when since t_signal >= 14
when trait A curious >= 0
text At 03:12 the dish picks up a reply. It's the fleet's own message, played back slowly. {A} is the first one awake.
do set signal_contact
do trait A curious 4

card signal_echo
type event
due
once
days 15 41
roles A
when flag signal_ignored
when since t_signal >= 14
text {A} notices the asteroid's pattern in the dish logs again. It is closer than it was. Nobody says "following".
do set echo_heard
do morale A -3

# Injury and rescue: needs supplies from another ship.
card crisis_eva
type event
once
days 10 34
weight 6
roles A
when cond A ok
when trait A brave >= 0
when kit_elsewhere A
text A micrometeoroid clips the hull during {A}'s EVA. {A} gets everyone's kit stowed and comes back in with a sprained wrist.
do cond A injured
do morale A -10
do open rescue_kit

card rescue_kit
type rescue
duration 1
roles A B
default volunteer
when cond A injured
when bestbond B A
text {A} needs a med kit from another ship.
option send | Send a med kit | A med kit goes over on the next shuttle. {A}'s wrist is strapped up by lunch.
  kit A
  morale A 6
option volunteer | {B} flies one over | {B} doesn't wait to be asked and flies a kit over personally.
  kitfrom B A
  move B A
  bond A B 12
  morale B 4
